1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,600
Rule nine. Never split up. Not once.
Not for a minute.

2
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:06,000
Too late. I already ran ahead.

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:12,500
On the third landing, your chest
locks. You sit down. The dark presses
on your ears. You can't call out.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:17,600
Then the dog barks. Again. Again. Far
above you, Sam hears it, and turns
around.

5
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:20,567
There! Chalk arrows! Hold on, I'm
coming, hold on!

6
00:00:21,067 --> 00:00:26,500
He finds you by your own white arrows,
and the dog. He sits beside you in the
dark and he stays.
